{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03963","headline":"奉和春日幸望春宫应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春春色最便妍，苑里花开列御筵。\n商山积翠临城起，滻水浮光共幕连。\n莺藏嫩叶歌相唤，蝶碍芳丛舞不前。\n欢娱节物今如此，愿奉宸游亿万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}